{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>And I will lie with my fathers.</b> A euphemism for death. Or its meaning is: do not bury me in Egypt, and I will lie with my fathers — and how will this be, that you will carry me from Egypt and bury me in their burial?"], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 47, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:48:11.185894356Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}